  },
  {
   "k": "8fwo68",
   "en": "/Hearts of Iron IV/common/units/names_ships"
  },
  {
   "k": "1y90tuv",
   "en": "TAG_ship_names.txt"
  },
  {
   "k": "w94v8r",
   "en": "In this file, it does not rely upon a set name within your OOB file like in division names, instead it is any ship. You will want to follow the following formatting:"
  },
  {
   "k": "9b93fe",
   "en": "Generic Names"
  },
  {
   "k": "1xk3fku",
   "en": "Defined in ⟦0⟧, for countries that lack specific names for types of equipment, especially for custom equipment that not every nation will use.",
